@startuml

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor black
}

actor "Admin" as User
participant "AdminPage" as UI
participant "AccountController" as Controller
participant "AccountService" as Service
participant "AppUserRepository / RoleRepository" as Repo
database "Database" as DB

== UC-08: Manage Staff Accounts ==

User -> UI : 1. Create or edit a staff account
activate User
activate UI

UI -> UI : 2. saveStaff()
activate UI
deactivate UI

UI -> UI : 3. Validate form/filter state
activate UI
deactivate UI

UI -> Controller : 4. POST /api/account/staff\nPUT /api/account/staff/{userId}
activate Controller

Controller -> Service : 5. createStaff(request) / updateStaff(userId, request)
activate Service

Service -> Service : 6. requireAdmin(); validate unique email/phone/password
activate Service
deactivate Service

alt Request is valid and authorized
  Service -> Repo : 7. findByEmail/Phone; findByRoleName; save
  activate Repo

  Repo -> DB : 8. SELECT role; INSERT/UPDATE app_user
  activate DB
  DB --> Repo : 9. Staff AppUser
  deactivate DB

  Repo --> Service : 10. Repository result
  deactivate Repo

  Service -> Service : 11. Assign Staff role; hash password; persist
  activate Service
  deactivate Service
else Validation, authorization, or state rule fails
  note over Service,Controller
    Duplicate identity / invalid role -> HTTP 400
    The service propagates ApiException to ApiExceptionHandler.
  end note
end

Service --> Controller : 12. Domain result or propagated error
deactivate Service

Controller -> Controller : 13. Serialize response
activate Controller
deactivate Controller

Controller --> UI : 14. HTTP 200 or mapped 4xx\nresponse body or error payload
deactivate Controller

UI -> UI : 15. loadStaff(); refreshAll()
activate UI
deactivate UI

UI --> User : 16. Show staff account saved

deactivate UI
deactivate User

@enduml
